<script type="application/json" id="mdData">"# The Worldmaker's Codex conversation: verbatim record\n\n- Chat: Hierarchical emoji table of contents\n- Link: https://claude.ai/chat/4da6a9f8-f2c6-495b-9505-d1e35f959cdd\n- Last active: October 6, 2026\n- Turns: 6 (3 from Aaron, 3 from Claude)\n- Every message is copied exactly as written. Claude's tool calls are kept word for word inside fenced blocks; the conversation record does not include the tool results.\n\n---\n\n## Turn 1: Aaron\n\nSYnthesize a table of contents with hierarchical emoji sections which reduce and order the contents according to table of contents of each and intermingle so they support eachother\n\n---\n\n## Turn 2: Claude\n\n# 📚 The Worldmaker's Codex\n*One curriculum built from the 31 books in your stack. It runs from cell to cosmos and from pencil to pixel. Each part pairs a **subject** (what to know) with a **craft** (how to render it), so the books teach through each other instead of sitting side by side.*\n\n---\n\n## 🔑 Source Key\n\n🧬 **Science & Body:** `MCB` Molecular & Cell Biology For Dummies · `WKY` Wild Kilted Yoga (Wilson)\n🗺️ **Place:** `RSS` Rick Steves Scotland · `LHE` The Lighthouse Encyclopedia (Jones)\n🏛️ **Architecture:** `JDA` Japanese Detail: Architecture (Hibi) · `HOC` The History of Castles (Gravett) · `BRN` Barn: Preservation & Adaptation · `HOG` The House of God (Norman)\n✏️ **Drawing:** `ICD` I Can Draw (Longhurst) · `LLD` Lifelike Drawing (Hammond) · `DRA` Draw Real Animals! (Hammond) · `DLP` Drawing Landscapes in Pencil (Petrie)\n🎨 **Painting:** `AAO` All About Techniques in Oil · `EYN` Everything You Need to Know About Oil Painting (Appellof) · `FOL` Fill Your Oil Paintings with Light & Color (Macpherson)\n🐉 **Fantasy Art:** `FLC` Fantasy Landscapes & Cityscapes (Alexander) · `DRG` Great Book of Dragon Patterns (Irish) · `DSC` Dreamscapes (Law) · `EGF` Explorer's Guide to Drawing Fantasy Creatures (Fiegenschuh) · `BVU` Vallejo & Bell: Ultimate Collection · `BVW` Fabulous Women of Vallejo & Bell\n💻 **Digital & Graphic:** `CGD` Complete Guide to Digital Illustration (Caplin & Banks) · `HYP` Hypergraphics (McKelvey) · `LUZ` Lürzer's 200 Best Digital Artists\n📖 **Sequential Art:** `WIG` Writing & Illustrating the Graphic Novel (Chinn) · `ICW` Incredible Comic Book Women (Nguyen)\n🎲 **Worldbuilding Systems:** `BOW` The Book of Worlds (White Wolf) · `SHR` Shadowrun (FASA) · `ARS` Ars Magica: The Art of Magic · `NEP` Nephilim · `CBG` Clanbook: Giovanni\n\n---\n\n## 🌱 Part I: Learning to See\n*First marks and the habit of observation*\n\n- ✏️ **1. Shapes Beneath Everything:** circles, boxes and cylinders as the skeleton of all subjects `ICD` ↔ `DLP`\n- 🌗 **2. Value & Light:** the five tones of shading, cast shadow, reflected light `LLD` ↔ `FOL`\n- 📐 **3. Perspective Basics:** horizon line, one-point and two-point perspective, atmospheric depth `DLP` ↔ `FLC`\n- 🧘 **4. The Artist's Body:** posture, breath and steadiness for long sessions at the easel `WKY`\n\n## 🧬 Part II: The Architecture of Life\n*Biology as the hidden logic of believable creatures*\n\n- 🔬 **5. The Cell:** membranes, organelles, and the cell as a tiny city `MCB` ↔ `HYP` (diagramming systems)\n- 🧪 **6. DNA → Protein → Form:** how code becomes structure `MCB`\n- 🔁 **7. Division, Inheritance & Mutation:** the rules of variation `MCB` ↔ `SHR` (metatypes) ↔ `EGF` (hybrids)\n- 🐾 **8. Drawing Real Animals:** eyes, fur, feathers, scales and hide textures in graphite `DRA` ↔ `LLD`\n\n## 🐉 Part III: Creatures of Imagination\n*Real anatomy pushed into the fantastic*\n\n- 🦴 **9. Plausible Monsters:** borrowing skeletons and musculature from real animals `EGF` ↔ `DRA` ↔ `MCB`\n- 🐲 **10. Dragon Anatomy & Pattern:** wings, scale tiling, coiled poses, line-art templates `DRG` ↔ `EGF`\n- 🧚 **11. Faery, Angel & Mermaid Forms:** winged and aquatic humanoids `DSC` ↔ `BVU`\n- 📓 **12. Field-Journal Presentation:** designing creatures as specimens in an explorer's notebook `EGF` ↔ `HYP`\n\n## 🧍 Part IV: The Human Figure\n*From breath to heroic pose*\n\n- 🧘 **13. Living Movement:** balance, twist and extension, drawn from yoga flows `WKY` ↔ `ICW`\n- 👤 **14. Lifelike Faces & Portraits:** proportions, the eye, skin texture `LLD`\n- 🦸‍♀️ **15. The Heroic Figure:** idealized anatomy, dynamic poses, costume `ICW` ↔ `BVW`\n- 💪 **16. Fantasy Realism Masters:** how Vallejo and Bell light and render the figure `BVU` ↔ `BVW` ↔ `FOL`\n\n## 🏞️ Part V: Land & Sky\n*Real terrain as the ground under every fantasy*\n\n- 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁳󠁣󠁴󠁿 **17. Scotland as Reference Realm:** Highlands, isles, lochs, Edinburgh `RSS` ↔ `WKY` (outdoor practice)\n- 🌲 **18. Pencil Landscapes:** trees, rocks, water and clouds in graphite `DLP`\n- ☀️ **19. Plein-Air Light & Color:** color temperature, time-of-day palettes, simplifying masses `FOL` ↔ `RSS`\n- 🌄 **20. Fantasy Terrain:** floating islands, impossible cliffs, epic scale `FLC` ↔ `DSC`\n\n## 🏛️ Part VI: The Built World\n*Architecture from humble to sacred, arranged as a progression*\n\n- 🛖 **21. Vernacular Timber:** barn framing, roofs, and adapting old structures `BRN` ↔ `JDA`\n- ⛩️ **22. Japanese Detail:** gates, fences, windows, roofs and joinery `JDA`\n- 🏰 **23. Castles Through Time:** motte-and-bailey to stone keep to concentric fortress `HOC` ↔ `RSS` ↔ `CBG` (family strongholds)\n- 🗼 **24. Lighthouses:** towers, lenses and coastal settings `LHE` ↔ `RSS` ↔ `DLP`\n- ⛪ **25. Houses of God:** basilica, Romanesque, Gothic, Baroque, modern `HOG` ↔ `CBG` (crypts and necropolis) ↔ `NEP` (occult sites)\n- 🌆 **26. Fantasy Cityscapes:** combining real styles into invented cities `FLC` ↔ all of Part VI\n\n## 🎨 Part VII: The Painter's Workshop\n*Oil painting, the bridge between drawing and digital*\n\n- 🧴 **27. Materials:** pigments, mediums, grounds, brushes `EYN` ↔ `AAO`\n- 🖌️ **28. Core Techniques:** alla prima, glazing, impasto, scumbling `AAO` ↔ `EYN`\n- 🌈 **29. Light Is Everything:** color harmony, edges, value keys `FOL` ↔ `BVU`\n- 🌌 **30. Painting the Dream:** luminous fantasy scenes `DSC` ↔ `BVU` ↔ `FLC`\n\n## 💻 Part VIII: The Digital Studio\n*Traditional skills carried into pixels*\n\n- 🖥️ **31. Digital Fundamentals:** layers, selections, masks, brushes `CGD`\n- 🧩 **32. Montage & Photo-Illustration:** compositing reference from Parts II, V and VI `CGD` ↔ `RSS` ↔ `HOC`\n- 🔗 **33. Hypergraphics:** nonlinear and interactive information design `HYP` ↔ `SHR` (Matrix interfaces)\n- 🏆 **34. The Benchmark:** studying contemporary digital masters `LUZ` ↔ `CGD`\n\n## 📖 Part IX: Story in Sequence\n*Turning images into narrative*\n\n- ✍️ **35. Scripting:** plot, pacing, the page as the unit of story `WIG`\n- 🗂️ **36. Panels & Layout:** gutters, page turns, splash pages `WIG` ↔ `HYP`\n- 👩‍🎤 **37. Characters Who Carry Story:** expression, silhouette, costume `ICW` ↔ `BVW`\n- 🖋️ **38. Inking, Lettering & Color:** finishing the page `WIG` ↔ `CGD`\n- 📕 **39. Covers That Sell:** iconic composition `BVU` ↔ `WIG`\n\n## 🎲 Part X: Systems of Worlds\n*The RPG books as frameworks that tie the setting together*\n\n- 🌐 **40. Cosmology:** realms, layered worlds, spirit geographies `BOW` ↔ `DSC`\n- ✨ **41. Magic as Grammar:** verb-and-noun spell systems, the Hermetic arts `ARS` ↔ `MCB` (systems thinking)\n- 🔮 **42. Elemental & Occult Hidden History:** reincarnated spirits and secret societies through the ages `NEP` ↔ `HOG` ↔ `HOC`\n- 🧛 **43. Lineage & Faction:** dynasties, guilds, necromantic houses `CBG` ↔ `HOC`\n- 🌃 **44. Magic Meets Machine:** cyberpunk-fantasy fusion, awakened metahumans, the Matrix `SHR` ↔ `MCB` ↔ `HYP` ↔ `LUZ`\n\n## 🔥 Part XI: Capstone Projects\n*Each project draws on 6 or more books*\n\n- 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁳󠁣󠁴󠁿 **45. The Haunted Isle:** a Scottish lighthouse realm with faery folk; pencil studies, then oil, then a digital cover `RSS` `LHE` `DLP` `DSC` `FOL` `CGD`\n- 🐉 **46. The Bestiary Codex:** a field journal of creatures built on genetic logic `MCB` `DRA` `EGF` `DRG` `HYP` `ARS`\n- 🏯 **47. Cathedral-Castle City:** a fantasy capital mixing Gothic, Japanese and barn vernacular `HOG` `JDA` `BRN` `HOC` `FLC` `CBG`\n- 📖 **48. The Graphic Novel Pilot:** 8 pages set in a Shadowrun-meets-Nephilim world `WIG` `ICW` `SHR` `NEP` `BOW` `LUZ`\n- 🖼️ **49. The Masterwork:** a heroic figure in a dreamscape, painted in the Vallejo/Bell tradition `BVU` `BVW` `WKY` `FOL` `EYN` `DSC`\n\n---\n\n*Chapter groupings are built from each book's general scope, not copied from their exact contents pages. A couple of spines are partly hidden, so if I misidentified the Clanbook or the Lürzer's volume, tell me and I'll adjust.*\n\nIf you'd like, I can turn this into an interactive HTML codex with clickable book-link graph lines between chapters.\n\n---\n\n## Turn 3: Aaron\n\nLets do an interactive HTML Codex and make graphics shine with threeJS effects using tsl.  add webgpu.  Demonstrate particle cloud 3d point storms to describe each.  Add a readaloud with chooseable voices\n\n---\n\n## Turn 4: Claude\n\n**Tool calls (17)**\n\n````text\n\u003ctool name=\"memory_read\">\n\u003cparameter name=\"path\">/topics/build-stack.md\u003c/parameter>\n\u003c/tool>\n\u003ctool name=\"view\">\n\u003cparameter name=\"description\">Read the frontend design skill before building the codex UI\u003c/parameter>\n\u003cparameter name=\"path\">/mnt/skills/public/frontend-design/SKILL.md\u003c/parameter>\n\u003c/tool>\n\u003ctool name=\"Artifact\">\n\u003cparameter name=\"action\">capabilities\u003c/parameter>\n\u003c/tool>\n\u003ctool name=\"bash_tool\">\n\u003cparameter name=\"command\">cat /mnt/user-data/outputs/artifacts/_contract/0.2.67/downloads.d.ts; echo ----; head -60 /mnt/user-data/outputs/artifacts/_contract/0.2.67/claude.d.ts; echo; curl -s https://registry.npmjs.org/three/latest | python3 -c \"import sys,json;d=json.load(sys.stdin);print(d['version'])\"\u003c/parameter>\n\u003cparameter name=\"description\">Check downloads contract and latest three version\u003c/parameter>\n\u003c/tool>\n\u003ctool name=\"bash_tool\">\n\u003cparameter name=\"command\">cd /tmp && curl -sL https://registry.npmjs.org/three/-/three-0.178.0.tgz -o t.tgz && tar xzf t.tgz && cd package/build && ls && head -c 600 three.tsl.js; echo; grep -o \"export {[^}]*}\" three.tsl.js | tr ',' '\\n' | grep -wE \"instancedArray|Fn|uniform|hash|instanceIndex|vec3|vec4|mix|sin|cos|time|deltaTime|length|normalize|If|smoothstep|mx_noise_vec3|color|uv|float|max|min|pass|positionLocal|attribute|clamp|abs|exp|cross|select|screenUV|mrt|emissive|output\" | head -50\u003c/parameter>\n\u003cparameter name=\"description\">Inspect three r178 TSL exports\u003c/parameter>\n\u003c/tool>\n\u003ctool name=\"bash_tool\">\n\u003cparameter name=\"command\">cd /tmp/package && ls examples/jsm/tsl/display/ | head -50; grep -n \"^const instancedArray\\|^const instancedArray = \" -A8 build/three.webgpu.js | head -30; grep -n \"class StorageInstancedBufferAttribute\" -A20 build/three.webgpu.js | head -30; grep -c \"class PostProcessing\" build/three.webgpu.js; grep -n \"computeAsync\\|^\\s*compute( computeNodes\" build/three.webgpu.js | head; grep -n \"export {\" build/three.webgpu.js | head -2; grep -o \"PostProcessing,\\|SpriteNodeMaterial,\\|PointsNodeMaterial,\\|WebGPURenderer,\\|AdditiveBlending,\\|InstancedMesh,\" build/three.webgpu.js | sort -u\u003c/parameter>\n\u003cparameter name=\"description\">Verify webgpu build APIs\u003c/parameter>\n\u003c/tool>\n\u003ctool name=\"bash_tool\">\n\u003cparameter name=\"command\">cd /tmp/package && sed -n 33015,33050p build/three.webgpu.js; grep -n \"^export const bloom\\|^export {\\|^export default\" examples/jsm/tsl/display/BloomNode.js; head -5 examples/jsm/tsl/display/BloomNode.js; grep -n \"^import\" examples/jsm/controls/OrbitControls.js\u003c/parameter>\n\u003cparameter name=\"description\">Check instancedArray and bloom export\u003c/parameter>\n\u003c/tool>\n\u003ctool name=\"bash_tool\">\n\u003cparameter name=\"command\">cd /tmp/package && grep -n \"class Sprite extends\" -A40 build/three.core.js | grep -n \"count\" ; grep -n \"object.count\\b\\|\\.count > 1\\|instanceCount\" build/three.webgpu.js | head -15; grep -n \"WebGPU.isAvailable\\|isWebGPUBackend\\|forceWebGL\" build/three.webgpu.js | head\u003c/parameter>\n\u003cparameter name=\"description\">Check instanced sprite count support\u003c/parameter>\n\u003c/tool>\n\u003ctool name=\"bash_tool\">\n\u003cparameter name=\"command\">cd /tmp/package && grep -n \"isStorageBuffer\" build/three.webgpu.js | head; grep -n \"class Attributes\" -A60 build/three.webgpu.js | grep -n \"version\" | head; grep -n \"get device\\|this.device = \" build/three.webgpu.js | head -4; grep -n \"toAttribute()\" build/three.webgpu.js | head -3\u003c/parameter>\n\u003cparameter name=\"description\">Confirm storage buffer re-upload on needsUpdate\u003c/parameter>\n\u003c/tool>\n\u003ctool name=\"bash_tool\">\n\u003cparameter name=\"command\">cd /tmp/package && sed -n 28805,28830p build/three.webgpu.js; sed -n 27375,27410p build/three.webgpu.js\u003c/parameter>\n\u003cparameter name=\"description\">Look at binding update logic\u003c/parameter>\n\u003c/tool>\n\u003ctool name=\"bash_tool\">\n\u003cparameter name=\"command\">cd /tmp/package && grep -oE \"^const (mx_noise_float|screenUV|hash|instancedArray|uv|smoothstep|oneMinus|pow|step|fract|atan|PI|TWO_PI|cameraPosition|positionWorld|vec2|float|uint|mod|dot|transformedNormalView) \" build/three.tsl.js | sort\u003c/parameter>\n\u003cparameter name=\"description\">Confirm a few TSL exports\u003c/parameter>\n\u003c/tool>\n\u003ctool name=\"bash_tool\">\n\u003cparameter name=\"command\">cd /tmp/package && grep -n \"class OrbitControls\" examples/jsm/controls/OrbitControls.js | head -2; grep -n \"setViewOffset\" build/three.core.js | head -2; grep -n \"backgroundNode\" build/three.webgpu.js | head -3\u003c/parameter>\n\u003cparameter name=\"description\">Sanity check a few APIs\u003c/parameter>\n\u003c/tool>\n\u003ctool name=\"create_file\">\n\u003cparameter name=\"description\">Interactive Worldmaker's Codex with TSL/WebGPU particle storms, read-aloud, and Aaron's canonical build stack\u003c/parameter>\n\u003cparameter name=\"path\">/mnt/user-data/outputs/worldmakers-codex.html\u003c/parameter>\n\u003cparameter name=\"file_text\">\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n\u003ctitle>The Worldmaker's Codex\u003c/title>\n\u003clink rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n\u003clink rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n\u003clink href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IM+Fell+English:ital@0;1&family=Alegreya+Sans:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\u003cstyle>\n:root{\n  --night:#0b1230; --lapis:#1b2a5c; --gilt:#d6ad55; --gilt-dim:rgba(214,173,85,.32);\n  --vellum:#efe4cb; --muted:#a9b1cc; --verdigris:#62b5a3; --madder:#c45a70;\n  --panel:rgba(11,18,48,.74); --panel-solid:#0e1738;\n  --display:\"IM Fell English\", \"Iowan Old Style\", \"Palatino Linotype\", Palatino, Georgia, serif;\n  --ui:\"Alegreya Sans\", \"Gill Sans\", \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif;\n  box-sizing:border-box;\n  padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px); padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);\n}\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){ :root:not([data-theme=\"light\"]){ --night:#0b1230; --panel:rgba(11,18,48,.74); --vellum:#efe4cb; } }\n:root[data-theme=\"dark\"]{ --night:#0b1230; --panel:rgba(11,18,48,.74); --vellum:#efe4cb; }\n*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:inherit}\nhtml{height:100%;scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}\nbody{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--night);color:var(--vellum);font-family:var(--ui);font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;overflow:hidden;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\nbutton,select,input{font:inherit;color:inherit}\nbutton{cursor:pointer}\n:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gilt);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:3px}\n#stage{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0}\n#stage canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none}\n\n/* masthead */\n.masthead{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;z-index:3;padding:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 18px) 22px 0;pointer-events:none;width:320px}\n.masthead h1{margin:0;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:1.9rem;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:.01em;color:var(--vellum)}\n.masthead h1 i{color:var(--gilt)}\n.masthead p{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-family:var(--display);font-style:italic;color:var(--muted);font-size:.98rem}\n\n/* spine */\n#spine{position:fixed;z-index:3;left:14px;top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 104px);bottom:calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) + 14px);width:300px;\n  background:var(--panel);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-left:2px solid var(--gilt);border-radius:2px 8px 8px 2px;\n  overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;padding:10px 8px 18px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--gilt-dim) transparent}\n.home-link{display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;width:100%;text-align:left;background:none;border:0;padding:.55rem .6rem;border-radius:4px;font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.08rem;color:var(--vellum)}\n.home-link:hover{background:rgba(214,173,85,.1)}\n.home-link.active{color:var(--gilt)}\n.part{margin-top:4px}\n.part-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6rem 2.1rem 1fr;align-items:baseline;width:100%;text-align:left;background:none;border:0;padding:.5rem .5rem;border-radius:4px}\n.part-head:hover{background:rgba(214,173,85,.08)}\n.part-head .roman{font-family:var(--display);color:var(--gilt);font-size:.95rem}\n.part-head .pt{font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.06rem;line-height:1.2}\n.part-head[aria-expanded=\"false\"] + ol{display:none}\n.chs{list-style:none;margin:0 0 6px;padding:0 0 0 1.4rem}\n.chs button{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.9rem 1fr;align-items:baseline;width:100%;text-align:left;background:none;border:0;border-left:2px solid transparent;padding:.28rem .45rem;font-size:.93rem;color:var(--muted);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0}\n.chs button .n{font-family:var(--display);font-size:.9rem;color:rgba(214,173,85,.7)}\n.chs button:hover{color:var(--vellum);background:rgba(255,255,255,.04)}\n.chs button.active{color:var(--vellum);border-left-color:var(--gilt);background:rgba(214,173,85,.12)}\n.chs button.lit{color:var(--vellum)}\n.chs button.lit::after{content:\"\";width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--verdigris);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--verdigris);position:absolute;right:10px;margin-top:.45rem}\n.chs li{position:relative}\n\n/* folio */\n#folio{position:fixed;z-index:3;right:14px;top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 64px);width:380px;max-height:calc(100% - 64px - 104px - env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) - env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));\n  overflow-y:auto;background:var(--panel);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-right:2px solid var(--gilt);border-radius:8px 2px 2px 8px;padding:22px 24px 18px;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--gilt-dim) transparent}\n.part-line{margin:0 0 .6rem;font-family:var(--display);font-style:italic;color:var(--gilt);font-size:1rem}\n.ch-title{margin:0 0 .9rem;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:2.05rem;line-height:1.08;color:var(--vellum)}\n.ch-title .ch-num{display:block;font-size:.95rem;font-style:italic;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:.2rem}\n.ch-desc{margin:0 0 1.1rem;font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.13rem;line-height:1.6;max-width:62ch}\n.dropcap{float:left;font-size:3.4rem;line-height:.8;padding:.32rem .45rem 0 0;color:var(--gilt);text-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(214,173,85,.45)}\n.w{transition:color .12s,text-shadow .12s}\n.w.speaking{color:#fff3cf;text-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(214,173,85,.9)}\n.seal-label{margin:0 0 .45rem;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.seals{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:0 0 1.1rem}\n.seal{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem;border:1px solid var(--gilt-dim);background:rgba(27,42,92,.55);border-radius:999px;padding:.2rem .65rem .2rem .45rem;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--vellum)}\n.seal:hover,.seal.speaking{border-color:var(--gilt);background:rgba(214,173,85,.16);box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(214,173,85,.35)}\n.seal b{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--gilt);font-size:.8rem}\n.book-meta{margin:-.4rem 0 1rem;font-style:italic;font-family:var(--display);color:var(--muted)}\n.feeds{list-style:none;margin:0 0 1rem;padding:0;display:grid;gap:4px}\n.feeds button{width:100%;text-align:left;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:4px;padding:.4rem .6rem;font-size:.95rem}\n.feeds button:hover{border-color:var(--gilt-dim)}\n.feeds .n{font-family:var(--display);color:var(--gilt);margin-right:.4rem}\n.folio-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;border-top:1px solid rgba(214,173,85,.18);padding-top:12px}\n.folio-nav button{background:none;border:1px solid var(--gilt-dim);border-radius:4px;padding:.38rem .8rem;font-size:.92rem}\n.folio-nav button:hover{border-color:var(--gilt);color:#fff}\n.folio-nav button:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:default}\n\n/* narrator */\n#narrator{position:fixed;z-index:4;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) + 16px);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;\n  background:var(--panel-solid);border:1px solid var(--gilt-dim);border-radius:14px;padding:8px 12px;box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.45);max-width:min(720px,calc(100% - 28px))}\n.play{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--gilt);background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%,#f1cf7c,#b4862e);color:#1a1405;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.05rem;box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(214,173,85,.35)}\n.play[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%,#8fe1cf,#3c8f7f)}\n.icon-btn{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--gilt-dim);background:none;display:grid;place-items:center}\n.icon-btn:hover{border-color:var(--gilt)}\n.nar-field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.nar-field select{background:#14204a;border:1px solid var(--gilt-dim);border-radius:6px;padding:.3rem .4rem;max-width:230px;font-size:.88rem}\n.nar-field input[type=range]{width:96px;accent-color:var(--gilt)}\n.keep{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--vellum)}\n.keep input{accent-color:var(--verdigris);width:16px;height:16px}\n\n/* top controls */\n.topbar{position:fixed;z-index:5;top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 14px);right:14px;display:flex;gap:8px}\n.topbar button,#contentsBtn{background:var(--panel-solid);border:1px solid var(--gilt-dim);border-radius:6px;padding:.4rem .8rem;font-size:.92rem}\n.topbar button:hover,#contentsBtn:hover{border-color:var(--gilt)}\n#contentsBtn{display:none;position:fixed;z-index:5;top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 14px);left:14px}\n.backend-tag{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);align-self:center;padding:0 .3rem}\n\n/* workshop */\n#workshop{position:fixed;z-index:6;top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 58px);right:14px;width:420px;max-height:calc(100% - 140px - env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) - env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));\n  overflow-y:auto;background:var(--panel-solid);border:1px solid var(--gilt-dim);border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.55);padding:14px 16px 16px}\n#workshop[hidden]{display:none}\n.ws-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px}\n.ws-head h2{margin:0;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:1.4rem}\n.tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(214,173,85,.2);margin-bottom:12px}\n.tabs button{background:none;border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;padding:.4rem .6rem;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.tabs button[aria-selected=\"true\"]{color:var(--vellum);border-bottom-color:var(--gilt)}\n.tabpanel[hidden]{display:none}\n.row{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px}\n.btn{background:#16234f;border:1px solid var(--gilt-dim);border-radius:6px;padding:.42rem .8rem;font-size:.9rem}\n.btn:hover{border-color:var(--gilt)}\n.btn.rec{border-color:var(--madder)}\n.btn.rec[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--madder);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}\n.hint{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);margin:.2rem 0 .8rem}\n.field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px}\n.field select,.field input[type=file]{background:#14204a;border:1px solid var(--gilt-dim);border-radius:6px;padding:.35rem;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--vellum);max-width:100%}\n#mixCanvas{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#060a1a;border:1px solid rgba(214,173,85,.2);border-radius:6px;display:block;margin-bottom:8px}\nprogress{width:100%;accent-color:var(--gilt);height:8px}\n.gallery{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:6px}\n.gallery li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:6px;align-items:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,.035);border-radius:6px;padding:.45rem .55rem}\n.gallery .meta{font-size:.84rem;overflow:hidden}\n.gallery .meta strong{display:block;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;color:var(--vellum)}\n.gallery .meta span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem}\n.gallery .acts{display:flex;gap:4px}\n.gallery .acts button{background:none;border:1px solid var(--gilt-dim);border-radius:4px;padding:.2rem .45rem;font-size:.78rem}\n.gallery .acts button.danger{border-color:rgba(196,90,112,.6)}\n.empty{color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;font-style:italic}\n.tele{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:2px 12px;font-size:.84rem;margin:0 0 12px}\n.tele dt{color:var(--muted)}\n.tele dd{margin:0;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--vellum)}\n.tele-h{font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.05rem;margin:.6rem 0 .3rem;color:var(--gilt);font-weight:400}\n\n/* modal + toast */\n#modal{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9;background:rgba(5,8,20,.82);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:20px}\n#modal[hidden]{display:none}\n#modal .box{background:var(--panel-solid);border:1px solid var(--gilt-dim);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;max-width:min(900px,100%);width:100%}\n#modal video{width:100%;max-height:70vh;background:#000;border-radius:6px;display:block}\n#modal .row{justify-content:flex-end;margin:10px 0 0}\n#toast{position:fixed;z-index:10;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 16px);background:var(--panel-solid);border:1px solid var(--gilt);border-radius:8px;padding:.5rem .9rem;font-size:.92rem;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .25s;max-width:calc(100% - 40px)}\n#toast.show{opacity:1}\n#fatal{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:1;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:30px;text-align:center;font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--muted)}\n#fatal[hidden]{display:none}\n\n@media (max-width: 1100px){ #spine{width:260px} #folio{width:330px} }\n@media (max-width: 860px){\n  .masthead{width:auto;right:0;padding-left:110px;padding-right:120px}\n  .masthead h1{font-size:1.3rem}\n  .masthead p{display:none}\n  #contentsBtn{display:block}\n  #spine{display:none;top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 60px);width:min(330px,calc(100% - 28px));z-index:7;background:var(--panel-solid)}\n  #spine.open{display:block}\n  #folio{top:auto;bottom:calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) + 80px);left:10px;right:10px;width:auto;max-height:40%;padding:14px 16px;border-right:0;border-top:2px solid var(--gilt);border-radius:2px 2px 10px 10px}\n  .ch-title{font-size:1.5rem}\n  .ch-desc{font-size:1.02rem}\n  .dropcap{font-size:2.6rem}\n  #narrator{bottom:calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) + 8px);gap:6px;padding:6px 8px}\n  .nar-field.opt{display:none}\n  .nar-field select{max-width:150px}\n  #workshop{left:10px;right:10px;width:auto}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){ *{transition:none!important} }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003cscript type=\"importmap\">\n{\n  \"imports\": {\n    \"three\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.178.0/build/three.webgpu.js\",\n    \"three/webgpu\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.178.0/build/three.webgpu.js\",\n    \"three/tsl\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.178.0/build/three.tsl.js\",\n    \"three/addons/\": \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.178.0/examples/jsm/\"\n  }\n}\n\u003c/script>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n\u003cdiv id=\"stage\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003c/div>\n\u003cdiv id=\"fatal\" hidden>\u003c/div>\n\n\u003cheader class=\"masthead\">\n  \u003ch1>The Worldmaker's \u003ci>Codex\u003c/i>\u003c/h1>\n  \u003cp>Thirty-one books, rewoven into one curriculum\u003c/p>\n\u003c/header>\n\n\u003cbutton id=\"contentsBtn\" aria-controls=\"spine\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Contents\u003c/button>\n\n\u003cnav id=\"spine\" aria-label=\"Codex contents\">\n  \u003cbutton class=\"home-link\" data-go=\"home\">🕸️ \u003cspan>The codex web\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n  \u003cdiv id=\"parts\">\u003c/div>\n\u003c/nav>\n\n\u003carticle id=\"folio\" aria-live=\"polite\">\u003c/article>\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"topbar\">\n  \u003cspan class=\"backend-tag\" id=\"backendTag\">Starting renderer…\u003c/span>\n  \u003cbutton id=\"workshopBtn\" aria-controls=\"workshop\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Workshop\u003c/button>\n\u003c/div>\n\n\u003cdiv id=\"narrator\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Read aloud\">\n  \u003cbutton class=\"play\" id=\"playBtn\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Read aloud\">▶\u003c/button>\n  \u003cbutton class=\"icon-btn\" id=\"stopBtn\" aria-label=\"Stop reading\">■\u003c/button>\n  \u003clabel class=\"nar-field\">Voice\u003cselect id=\"voiceSel\" aria-label=\"Voice\">\u003c/select>\u003c/label>\n  \u003clabel class=\"nar-field opt\">Speed\u003cinput type=\"range\" id=\"rateIn\" min=\"0.6\" max=\"1.6\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"0.95\">\u003c/label>\n  \u003clabel class=\"nar-field opt\">Pitch\u003cinput type=\"range\" id=\"pitchIn\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"1.5\" step=\"0.05\" value=\"1\">\u003c/label>\n  \u003clabel class=\"keep\">\u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" id=\"keepIn\" checked> Keep reading\u003c/label>\n\u003c/div>\n\n\u003caside id=\"workshop\" hidden aria-label=\"Workshop\">\n  \u003cdiv class=\"ws-head\">\u003ch2>Workshop\u003c/h2>\u003cbutton class=\"icon-btn\" id=\"wsClose\" aria-label=\"Close workshop\">✕\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n    \u003cbutton role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-tab=\"rec\">Record\u003c/button>\n    \u003cbutton role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"mix\">Mixer\u003c/button>\n    \u003cbutton role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"gal\">Gallery\u003c/button>\n    \u003cbutton role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"tel\">Telemetry\u003c/button>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003csection class=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"rec\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"row\">\n      \u003cbutton class=\"btn rec\" id=\"recCanvasBtn\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Record the storm\u003c/button>\n      \u003cspan id=\"recCanvasTime\" class=\"hint\" style=\"margin:0\">\u003c/span>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cp class=\"hint\">Captures the 3D view at 60 fps, with storm sound if it is on. Narration voices can't be captured here; use screen recording with tab audio for that.\u003c/p>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"row\">\n      \u003cbutton class=\"btn rec\" id=\"recScreenBtn\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Record screen\u003c/button>\n      \u003cspan id=\"recScreenTime\" class=\"hint\" style=\"margin:0\">\u003c/span>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cp class=\"hint\">Asks which screen, window or tab to capture. Choose this tab and share its audio to include narration.\u003c/p>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"row\">\u003cbutton class=\"btn\" id=\"humBtn\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Storm sound: off\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\n    \u003cp class=\"hint\" id=\"mimeHint\">\u003c/p>\n  \u003c/section>\n\n  \u003csection class=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"mix\" hidden>\n    \u003clabel class=\"field\">Video clip\u003cselect id=\"mixVideoSel\">\u003c/select>\u003c/label>\n    \u003clabel class=\"field\">…or a video file\u003cinput type=\"file\" id=\"mixVideoFile\" accept=\"video/*\">\u003c/label>\n    \u003clabel class=\"field\">Music (MP3 or other audio)\u003cinput type=\"file\" id=\"mixAudioFile\" accept=\"audio/*,.mp3\">\u003c/label>\n    \u003clabel class=\"field\">Fit the video to the music by\n      \u003cselect id=\"mixMode\">\n        \u003coption value=\"loop\">Looping the clip\u003c/option>\n        \u003coption value=\"pingpong\">Ping-pong, forward then back\u003c/option>\n        \u003coption value=\"shuffle\">Shuffle-cutting segments\u003c/option>\n        \u003coption value=\"ramp\">Speed-ramping across the song\u003c/option>\n      \u003c/select>\n    \u003c/label>\n    \u003ccanvas id=\"mixCanvas\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\">\u003c/canvas>\n    \u003cprogress id=\"mixProg\" value=\"0\" max=\"1\">\u003c/progress>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">\n      \u003cbutton class=\"btn\" id=\"mixGo\">Render mix\u003c/button>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"btn\" id=\"mixCancel\" disabled>Cancel\u003c/button>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cp class=\"hint\">The finished mix ends exactly when the music ends and is saved to the gallery.\u003c/p>\n  \u003c/section>\n\n  \u003csection class=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"gal\" hidden>\n    \u003cul class=\"gallery\" id=\"gallery\">\u003c/ul>\n  \u003c/section>\n\n  \u003csection class=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"tel\" hidden>\n    \u003ch3 class=\"tele-h\">Device\u003c/h3>\n    \u003cdl class=\"tele\" id=\"teleDev\">\u003c/dl>\n    \u003ch3 class=\"tele-h\">Live totals\u003c/h3>\n    \u003cdl class=\"tele\" id=\"teleLive\">\u003c/dl>\n  \u003c/section>\n\u003c/aside>\n\n\u003cdiv id=\"modal\" hidden role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Clip player\">\n  \u003cdiv class=\"box\">\u003cvideo id=\"modalVideo\" controls playsinline>\u003c/video>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"row\">\u003cbutton class=\"btn\" id=\"modalClose\">Close\u003c/button>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cdiv id=\"toast\" role=\"status\">\u003c/div>\n\n\u003cscript type=\"module\">\n/* ============================================================\n   DATA — books, parts, chapters\n   ============================================================ */\nconst BOOKS = {\n  MCB:['Molecular & Cell Biology For Dummies','Rene Fester Kratz','🧬'],\n  WKY:['Wild Kilted Yoga','Finlay Wilson','🧘'],\n  RSS:['Rick Steves Scotland','Rick Steves','🗺️'],\n  LHE:['The Lighthouse Encyclopedia','Ray Jones','🗼'],\n  JDA:['Japanese Detail: Architecture','Sadao Hibi','⛩️'],\n  HOC:['The History of Castles','Christopher Gravett','🏰'],\n  BRN:['Barn: Preservation and Adaptation','Endersby, Greenwood & Larkin','🛖'],\n  HOG:['The House of God','Edward Norman','⛪'],\n  ICD:['I Can Draw','Terry Longhurst','✏️'],\n  LLD:['Lifelike Drawing','Lee Hammond','👁️'],\n  DRA:['Draw Real Animals!','Lee Hammond','🐾'],\n  DLP:['Drawing Landscapes in Pencil','Ferdinand Petrie','🌲'],\n  AAO:['All About Techniques in Oil','Barron\\'s','🖌️'],\n  EYN:['Everything You Need to Know About Oil Painting','Marian Appellof','🧴'],\n  FOL:['Fill Your Oil Paintings with Light & Color','Kevin Macpherson','☀️'],\n  FLC:['Drawing & Painting Fantasy Landscapes & Cityscapes','Rob Alexander','🌄'],\n  DRG:['Great Book of Dragon Patterns','Lora S. Irish','🐉'],\n  DSC:['Dreamscapes','Stephanie Pui-Mun Law','🧚'],\n  EGF:['The Explorer\\'s Guide to Drawing Fantasy Creatures','Karl Fiegenschuh','🦴'],\n  BVU:['Boris Vallejo & Julie Bell: The Ultimate Collection','Boris Vallejo & Julie Bell','💪'],\n  BVW:['The Fabulous Women of Boris Vallejo and Julie Bell','Boris Vallejo & Julie Bell','🌟'],\n  CGD:['The Complete Guide to Digital Illustration','Steve Caplin & Adam Banks','🖥️'],\n  HYP:['Hypergraphics','Roy McKelvey','🔗'],\n  LUZ:['Lürzer\\'s Archive: 200 Best Digital Artists Worldwide','Lürzer\\'s Archive','🏆'],\n  WIG:['Writing and Illustrating the Graphic Novel','Mike Chinn','📖'],\n  ICW:['Incredible Comic Book Women','Tom Nguyen','🦸'],\n  BOW:['The Book of Worlds','White Wolf','🌐'],\n  SHR:['Shadowrun','FASA Corporation','🌃'],\n  ARS:['Ars Magica: The Art of Magic','Ars Magica line','✨'],\n  NEP:['Nephilim','Chaosium','🔮'],\n  CBG:['Clanbook: Giovanni','White Wolf','🧛']\n};\n\nconst PARTS = [\n  {e:'🌱',r:'I',   t:'Learning to see',          s:'First marks and the habit of observation',            pal:['#8f9bb8','#efe4cb','#d6ad55'], spark:'#ffffff'},\n  {e:'🧬',r:'II',  t:'The architecture of life', s:'Biology as the hidden logic of believable creatures', pal:['#3fa58f','#6fd3ff','#c45a70'], spark:'#e8fff8'},\n  {e:'🐉',r:'III', t:'Creatures of imagination', s:'Real anatomy pushed into the fantastic',              pal:['#b23a2a','#f08a3a','#ffd36b'], spark:'#fff1c4'},\n  {e:'🧍',r:'IV',  t:'The human figure',         s:'From breath to heroic pose',                         pal:['#6f86ff','#d98a9a','#f2c46a'], spark:'#fff4e8'},\n  {e:'🏞️',r:'V',   t:'Land and sky',             s:'Real terrain as the ground under every fantasy',      pal:['#5d9cff','#6fae6a','#b07ad6'], spark:'#f4f7ff'},\n  {e:'🏛️',r:'VI',  t:'The built world',          s:'Architecture from humble to sacred',                  pal:['#5a78d0','#c9b79a','#ffcf6b'], spark:'#fff6dc'},\n  {e:'🎨',r:'VII', t:'The painter\\'s workshop',  s:'Oil painting, the bridge between drawing and digital', pal:['#3f5bff','#e04a6a','#ffb347'], spark:'#fff3e0'},\n  {e:'💻',r:'VIII',t:'The digital studio',       s:'Traditional skills carried into pixels',              pal:['#2fd8ff','#a46bff','#ff4fd8'], spark:'#f0fbff'},\n  {e:'📖',r:'IX',  t:'Story in sequence',        s:'Turning images into narrative',                       pal:['#7f8fff','#ff5a5a','#ffd85a'], spark:'#ffffff'},\n  {e:'🎲',r:'X',   t:'Systems of worlds',        s:'The game books as frameworks that tie the setting together', pal:['#7a4dff','#3fe0c0','#ffcf6b'], spark:'#f3eaff'},\n  {e:'🔥',r:'XI',  t:'Capstone projects',        s:'Each project draws on six books',                     pal:['#ff6a3d','#ffcf6b','#ff8fb8'], spark:'#fff8e8'}\n];\nconst HOME_PAL = {pal:['#62b5a3','#efe4cb','#d6ad55'], spark:'#fff6dc'};\n\nconst CH = [\n [0,'✏️','Shapes beneath everything','Every subject starts as circles, boxes, cylinders and cones. Learn to see the simple solids under animals, castles and faces before adding a single detail.',['ICD','DLP'],'primitives'],\n [0,'🌗','Value and light','The five tones of shading are highlight, light, halftone, core shadow and reflected light. The same ladder of values governs a graphite sphere and an oil-painted sunset.',['LLD','FOL'],'valueSphere'],\n [0,'📐','Perspective basics','Horizon line, one- and two-point perspective, and atmospheric depth. These rules let a pencil landscape and an impossible fantasy city share the same believable space.',['DLP','FLC'],'perspective'],\n [0,'🧘','The artist\\'s body','Posture, breath and steadiness for long sessions at the easel. A loose, grounded body makes a looser, more confident line.',['WKY'],'lotus'],\n [1,'🔬','The cell','Membranes, organelles and the nucleus: the cell as a tiny walled city. Diagramming it is a first exercise in information design.',['MCB','HYP'],'cell'],\n [1,'🧪','DNA to protein to form','How a four-letter code is read, copied and folded into structure. Form follows instructions, in biology and in creature design alike.',['MCB'],'helix'],\n [1,'🔁','Division, inheritance and mutation','Mitosis, meiosis and the rules of variation. Mutation is the engine behind Shadowrun\\'s metatypes and every believable hybrid creature.',['MCB','SHR','EGF'],'mitosis'],\n [1,'🐾','Drawing real animals','Eyes, fur, feathers, scales and hide, rendered in graphite from life and photo reference. Real texture is the vocabulary that fantasy borrows.',['DRA','LLD'],'quadruped'],\n [2,'🦴','Plausible monsters','Build fantastic beasts on real skeletons and musculature. Borrow a horse\\'s legs, a bat\\'s wing and a reptile\\'s hide, then make the joints work.',['EGF','DRA','MCB'],'chimera'],\n [2,'🐲','Dragon anatomy and pattern','Wing structure, scale tiling, coiled poses and clean line-art templates. Pattern turns a sketch into a design you can carve, paint or print.',['DRG','EGF'],'dragon'],\n [2,'🧚','Faery, angel and mermaid forms','Winged and aquatic humanoids: where wings attach, how tails replace legs, and how light passes through gossamer.',['DSC','BVU'],'fairy'],\n [2,'📓','The field-journal presentation','Present creatures as specimens in an explorer\\'s notebook, with annotations, scale bars and habitat notes. Layout tells the reader the creature is real.',['EGF','HYP'],'book'],\n [3,'🧘','Living movement','Balance, twist and extension drawn from yoga flows. A pose you can feel in your own body is a pose you can draw convincingly.',['WKY','ICW'],'figureYoga'],\n [3,'👤','Lifelike faces and portraits','Facial proportions, the structure of the eye, and smooth skin texture through blending. Likeness lives in small measured relationships.',['LLD'],'face'],\n [3,'🦸','The heroic figure','Idealized anatomy, dynamic action poses and costume that reads at a glance. Exaggeration works only when the underlying anatomy is right.',['ICW','BVW'],'hero'],\n [3,'💪','Fantasy realism masters','How Vallejo and Bell light the figure: strong rim light, saturated shadow color and polished surfaces. Study their light as much as their subjects.',['BVU','BVW','FOL'],'heroLit'],\n [4,'🗺️','Scotland as reference realm','Highlands, islands, lochs and Edinburgh\\'s old town as a ready-made fantasy setting. Travel reference grounds invented worlds in real weather and stone.',['RSS','WKY'],'highlands'],\n [4,'🌲','Pencil landscapes','Trees, rocks, water and clouds in graphite. Each has its own stroke: scribble for foliage, crisp edges for rock, a horizontal pull for still water.',['DLP'],'tree'],\n [4,'☀️','Plein-air light and color','Color temperature, time-of-day palettes and simplifying big masses. Paint the light first and the objects second.',['FOL','RSS'],'sun'],\n [4,'🌄','Fantasy terrain','Floating islands, impossible cliffs and epic scale. Start from real geology, then break exactly one rule.',['FLC','DSC'],'islands'],\n [5,'🛖','Vernacular timber','Barn framing, roof shapes and the craft of adapting old structures. Honest construction gives any building a lived-in history.',['BRN','JDA'],'barn'],\n [5,'⛩️','Japanese detail','Gates, fences, windows, roofs and joinery seen up close. Detail at this scale teaches restraint and rhythm.',['JDA'],'torii'],\n [5,'🏰','Castles through time','From motte-and-bailey to stone keep to concentric fortress. Each stage answers a new siege weapon, and every lineage needs a stronghold.',['HOC','RSS','CBG'],'castle'],\n [5,'🗼','Lighthouses','Towers, lenses and keepers\\' houses on hostile coasts. A lighthouse is architecture, landscape and story in one silhouette.',['LHE','RSS','DLP'],'lighthouse'],\n [5,'⛪','Houses of God','Basilica, Romanesque, Gothic, Baroque and modern sacred space. Crypts and spires double as stages for secret histories.',['HOG','CBG','NEP'],'cathedral'],\n [5,'🌆','Fantasy cityscapes','Combine barns, pagodas, keeps and spires into invented cities that still feel inhabited. Every real style from this part becomes a district.',['FLC','HOG','HOC','JDA','BRN'],'city'],\n [6,'🧴','Materials','Pigments, mediums, grounds and brushes, and what each does to the paint film. Good materials remove friction between intent and mark.',['EYN','AAO'],'palette'],\n [6,'🖌️','Core techniques','Alla prima, glazing, impasto and scumbling. Each technique handles light differently, so choose by the surface you want to depict.',['AAO','EYN'],'strokes'],\n [6,'🌈','Light is everything','Color harmony, edge control and value keys. Get the value right and the color can be almost anything.',['FOL','BVU'],'colorWheel'],\n [6,'🌌','Painting the dream','Luminous fantasy scenes that glow from within. Combine glazes, controlled edges and a single strong light source.',['DSC','BVU','FLC'],'dream'],\n [7,'🖥️','Digital fundamentals','Layers, selections, masks and custom brushes. The digital canvas is non-destructive, so experiment freely and keep every step.',['CGD'],'pixels'],\n [7,'🧩','Montage and photo-illustration','Composite your own reference from Scotland, castles and animals into seamless scenes. Match light direction and grain, and the seams vanish.',['CGD','RSS','HOC'],'layers'],\n [7,'🔗','Hypergraphics','Nonlinear and interactive information design: links, layers and paths a reader chooses. The same thinking shapes a Matrix interface in Shadowrun.',['HYP','SHR'],'network'],\n [7,'🏆','The benchmark','Study two hundred contemporary digital artists for range, finish and nerve. Copy for learning, then name what makes each one distinct.',['LUZ','CGD'],'laurel'],\n [8,'✍️','Scripting','Plot, pacing and the page as the basic unit of story. Know what each page turn reveals.',['WIG'],'scroll'],\n [8,'🗂️','Panels and layout','Gutters, page turns and splash pages guide the eye through time. Panel shape is a pacing tool.',['WIG','HYP'],'panels'],\n [8,'👩‍🎤','Characters who carry story','Expression, silhouette and costume that stay readable at thumbnail size. A strong character is recognizable in solid black.',['ICW','BVW'],'heroSil'],\n [8,'🖋️','Inking, lettering and color','Line weight, balloon placement and flat-to-rendered color. Finishing is where the page becomes legible.',['WIG','CGD'],'quill'],\n [8,'📕','Covers that sell','Iconic composition built around a single dominant figure and a clear focal point.',['BVU','WIG'],'cover'],\n [9,'🌐','Cosmology','Realms, layered worlds and spirit geographies stacked above and below the everyday. A map of the cosmos tells players what is possible.',['BOW','DSC'],'galaxy'],\n [9,'✨','Magic as grammar','Ars Magica builds spells from verbs and nouns, techniques acting on forms. Treat magic as a system with rules, the way biology treats life.',['ARS','MCB'],'sigil'],\n [9,'🔮','Elemental and occult hidden history','Reincarnated elemental spirits and secret societies moving through the ages. Real castles and cathedrals become their meeting places.',['NEP','HOG','HOC'],'flame'],\n [9,'🧛','Lineage and faction','Dynasties, guilds and necromantic houses with their own strongholds and secrets. Family trees are plot engines.',['CBG','HOC'],'lineage'],\n [9,'🌃','Magic meets machine','Cyberpunk-fantasy fusion: awakened metahumans, dragons and the Matrix. Biology, interface design and digital art all meet here.',['SHR','MCB','HYP','LUZ'],'cyber'],\n [10,'🏝️','The haunted isle','A Scottish lighthouse realm with faery folk. Pencil studies first, then oil, then a digital cover.',['RSS','LHE','DLP','DSC','FOL','CGD'],'isle'],\n [10,'🐉','The bestiary codex','A field journal of creatures built on genetic logic, with a magic system that explains them.',['MCB','DRA','EGF','DRG','HYP','ARS'],'bestiary'],\n [10,'🏯','Cathedral-castle city','A fantasy capital mixing Gothic, Japanese and barn vernacular, ruled by an old lineage.',['HOG','JDA','BRN','HOC','FLC','CBG'],'capital'],\n [10,'📖','The graphic novel pilot','Eight pages set in a world where Shadowrun meets Nephilim.',['WIG','ICW','SHR','NEP','BOW','LUZ'],'pilot'],\n [10,'🖼️','The masterwork','A heroic figure in a dreamscape, painted in the Vallejo and Bell tradition.',['BVU','BVW','WKY','FOL','EYN','DSC'],'masterwork']\n].map((a,i)=>({i,n:i+1,p:a[0],e:a[1],t:a[2],d:a[3],b:a[4],shape:a[5]}));\nconst BOOK_CODES = Object.keys(BOOKS);\nconst feedsOf = code => CH.filter(c=>c.b.includes(code));\n\n/* ============================================================\n   SHAPE LIBRARY — CPU-side target clouds (xyz + color param w)\n   ============================================================ */\nlet R = Math.random;\nconst rng = seed => { let s = seed>>>0; return () => { s = 